WHICH TEXTS

The editorial matter written for this apparatus: the orientations and textual
histories, the glossary, the discernment lexicon, the internal divisions and
key-passage notes, together with the prose of the site's own pages (method,
overview, and the notes displayed with each work) and of README.md.

Concretely: data/introductions.json, data/glossary.json, data/lexicon.json,
data/sections.json, and the editorial prose embedded in app.js and index.html.

